# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling — always ignore, never source
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal working data — entirely gitignored, entirely rebuildable
# (fetched from DBT/PKF/helloAO APIs, or computed by the comparison
# pipeline). See pipeline/paths.py for the constants scripts use to reach
# this instead of hardcoding the path.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
internal-data/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated build output — rebuilt via `make dbt-metadata`, never edited
# by hand.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
export/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only, not for publication
#
# Anchored to the repo root (leading /) — a bare "examples/" would match
# ANY directory named "examples" anywhere in the tree, which silently
# swallowed the brand-new, definitely-should-be-tracked doc/examples/
# until this was caught and fixed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/CLAUDE.local.md
/examples/
/bak/
/internal-docs/

# Mistakenly copied into the repo root by MONO during the 2026-07-28
# catalog ownership handover (before MONO discovered this repo's real
# structure lives in internal-data/ + pipeline/core/) — same
# rebuildable-cache/generated-output category as internal-data/ and
# export/ above, just at the wrong path. Pending proper reconciliation
# (examples/bibles-catalog-ownership-handover.md §1) — gitignored in the
# meantime so 656M+54M of duplicate/generated data doesn't get committed
# by accident.
/api-cache/
/sorted/

# Everything under data/ (data/vrs/, data/version-exclude.toml) is real,
# hand-curated source data and stays tracked.
